{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLTIwMTUvVGVra2VuJTIwS2F6dXlhJTI3cyUyMFJldmVuZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDE0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Tekken Kazuya's Revenge","description":"A young man, Kazuya Mishima, wakes up alone in an unfamiliar hotel room without any recollection of who he is or how he got there. He is tormented by flashes of his past and by the face of an ominous stranger. The next thing he knows, Kazuya is ambushed and kidnapped by an underground crime organization and, soon after, turned into a ruthless assassin.  During a mission to assassinate a man named Brian Fury, Kazuya finds that his target harbors clues to his true identity. With the help of Fury and a female assassin, Kazuya follows the clues, leading him to the lab of his reoccurring flashbacks. Here, he will finally confront his past and the ominous man of his nightmares - Heihachi Mishima, face the ultimate betrayal, and learn the truth about who, and what, he really is.\n\nRated NR · Released 21 Aug 2014 · United States · Language: English · 90 min\nStudio: SP Entertainments\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Action","Bollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5e3b7xHJhpzl1p49JclT03VQVgU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fAKGXzLlFI4dnWNC3ZAu6wLYoSK.jpg","imdbRating":"3.9","imdb_id":"tt3462696","moviedb_id":286548,"tmdbId":286548,"runtime":"90 min","cast":["Kane Kosugi","Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa","Gary Daniels","Charlotte Kirk","Rade Šerbedžija","Sahajak Boonthanakit","Ron Smoorenburg","Russell Geoffrey Banks"],"director":["Wych Kaosayananda"],"writer":["Nicole Jones-Dion"],"released":"2014-08-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Survival Is No Game","country":"United States","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Wych Kaosayananda","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bCT4OpbdSU3SKWwg6ecwedm5uKT.jpg"},{"name":"Kane Kosugi","character":"Kazuya","photo":"https://image.